[[File:Fine Park Detective Pikachu.png|thumb|280px|A depiction of the park from [[Detective Pikachu Ryme City Guide]]]]
'''Fine Park''' (Japanese: '''ファインパーク''' ''Fine Park'') is an abandoned amusement park in the game {{OBP|Detective Pikachu|video game}}. It is located west of central [[Ryme City|Ryme]] in the Fork Hand district<ref>Detective Pikachu Ryme City Guide</ref>. It was closed down a year ago after an incident involving a {{p|Charizard}}; however, a few Pokémon still remain there. It lies opposite (Japanese: '''ショータイムアベニュー''' ''Showtime Avenue'') which had previously been lined with many popular theaters and cafés. Most of Chapter 5 takes place here.

